rooms_desc ({"You are standing in the entrance room of Troubadix's house.As you look around you instantly notice that this must bedecorated by a bard. You can see lots of pictures hangingon the walls and on each one you can see an instrument hanging over the doors. On the northern wall there is a harp. On the southern wall there is a benjo. On the easternwall there is a miniature of a piano and on the westernwall there is hanging a violin. Everything looks nice in here.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
